==Battleground==
*6 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

